+/* Turns off the small-primitive cull in visibility-buffer triangle culling shaders.
+ * The cull rejects a triangle when its screen-space bounds round to the same sample position,
+ * and branches on OpFOrdEqual(RoundEven(a), RoundEven(b)) results combined with OpLogicalOr.
